Hunter of the Shadows wrote:
> Am I to understand that more is required of wraiths than just killing them?

They have to leave corpses. There are various methods that increase the
chance that any given wraith will leave a corpse. One method is to have
a trap or monster kill them. Another common method is to take the wraith
to a different level before killing it; wraiths will have a higher
chance of leaving a corpse if they're on a level with no graveyards
(that isn't the Castle: luring from the Valley tends to be pointless).

